  "summary": "The experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in singleprofile settings, achieving validation accuracy of 0.520 and F1 of 0.498, outperforming the pca_n2000 baseline (0.485 accuracy). This suggests the scvi_n200 encoder may provide consistent benefits across profile settings, but its relative impact compared to multiprofile configurations or other encoders remains uncertain. Further experiments are needed to isolate encoder-specific effects and validate trends across modalities."
}

